    "/api/courses/{id}/yanhekt/sessions": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "autoslides_session_metadata",
        "summary": "id 是 course ID；from 为偏移；每次 30 条，按 next 翻页",
        "description": "course/total/from/next/sessions；id/title/week/day/startedAt/endedAt/room/recorded 可空或单条 error；不含 video ID\n\n索引尚未完整；403 HTML 不是空结果；本环境未通过线上读取验收。详见 docs/autoslides.md。",
